# The accounts of the workstation that belong to the group `workbench`, one
# on each line: each specialist, the host account `<workspace>-host`, and the
# twin of each specialist for the breakout rooms (`<specialist>-bg`). The
# twins are outside the device groups.
# The git account `workbench-git` is outside the group. The image, setup.sh,
# and test/workstation-config.test.ts read this file.
#
# Add a new account at the end. The image gives the accounts the uids 1000 and
# up in the order of this file, and the git account 1900. An account inserted
# above another one changes the uid of that account. The next start repairs the
# home of the account, but the files that it owns in /shared and in the audit
# log keep the old uid.
researcher
engineer
workbench-host
researcher-bg
engineer-bg
